>greet_prog 60~
if ispc($n)
  say Welcome to the Great Library of Karras.  Please do not touch the books.  Or breathe on them.  Or look at them too hard.
endif
~
>speech_prog karras history clans~
if ispc($n)
  say Karras is an island in the Sea of Tears, and the minotaurs came here long ago in great canoes.  For centuries we were one people.
  say Then came the quarrel: whether the axe of Karras is a tool for building, or for killing.  The Byterians took the white blade and the Kinthalas the red, and we have shared this fortress, and very little else, ever since.
endif
~
